{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #222222; font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\u0026#34;PingFang SC\u0026#34;,\u0026#34;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#34;,sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; letter-spacing: 0.5px; overflow-wrap: anywhere\"\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e去掉多余框线与装饰，只留白纸黑字与一抹朱红数字，让观点自己说话。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 title=\"用大号数字撑起整篇节奏\" style=\"margin: 32px 0 24px; color: #bb3326; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere\"\u003e01\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e舒展的行距与段距承担阅读节奏，重点句只在关键处加粗一次。当形式退后一步，思考的锋芒就会浮现出来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 24px 0; padding: 0; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e好的长文排版，是让读者忘记排版的存在。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003ch2 title=\"克制留白的耐读法则\" style=\"margin: 32px 0 24px; color: #bb3326; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere\"\u003e02\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e无论是深度评论、读书随笔还是年度复盘，纯白底与一抹朱红都能经得起长时间手机端阅读。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"极简建筑天窗光影\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 24px auto\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\"\u003e留下真正值得思考的句子，其余交给留白。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
